EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Dear {Applicant_Full_Name}, 

Thank you for submitting your application for {Scheme_Name}. This email confirms that your application has been received by the India Alliance. 

Application Details:
- Applicant: {Applicant name} 
- Application ID: {Reference ID} 
- Grant Title: {Project Title} 
- Date Submitted: {Submission date} 

Please quote your Application ID in any future correspondence regarding this application. Your application will now go through the review process; we will contact you separately regarding the outcome of your application. 

If you have any questions, please contact us at grants@indiaalliance.org, quoting your Application ID.

Regards, 
Grants Team 
India Alliance
